{'symbol': 'BIO', 'date': '2023-02-16 16:05:00', 'title': 'BIO-RAD REPORTS FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'HERCULES, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BIO-RAD LABORATORIES, INC. (NYSE: BIO AND BIOB), A GLOBAL LEADER IN LIFE SCIENCE RESEARCH AND CLINICAL DIAGNOSTIC PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. FOURTH-QUARTER 2022 NET SALES WERE $730.3 MILLION, A DECREASE OF 0.3 PERCENT COMPARED TO $732.8 MILLION REPORTED FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021.'}